{"seq":2,"slug":"human-in-the-loop","title":"人工审批环节的建模与实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/patterns/human-in-the-loop","wordCount":2024,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"人工审批环节的建模与实现\">人工审批环节的建模与实现</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Human-in-the-Loop（HITL）</strong>：工作流中需要人类判断力介入的环节，等待时间从分钟到数天不等</li>\n<li><strong>Signal</strong>：外部系统向运行中工作流传递数据的异步通知机制，用于传入审批结果</li>\n<li><strong>Condition + Timer</strong>：等待条件满足或超时的组合，是 HITL 的基础实现模式</li>\n<li><strong>Human-Veto 模式</strong>：默认自动执行，仅在人工明确否决时停止——与阻塞审批相反的交互模式</li>\n<li><strong>决策信封</strong>：包含请求 ID、规则版本、审批主体、权限证明、决定和时间戳的不可变输入，用于鉴权、去重与审计</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"为什么工作流需要人工介入\">为什么工作流需要人工介入</h2><p>全自动化是理想状态，但现实业务中大量场景需要人的判断力介入：高金额交易需要风控人员审批、AI 生成的内容需要人工确认、异常订单需要客服裁定、合规要求某些操作必须有人签字。这些「人工环节」（Human-in-the-Loop, HITL）的特殊性在于：等待时间不确定（分钟到天），且等待期间工作流必须保持状态——不能占用计算资源、不能丢失上下文。</p>\n<p>工作流引擎适合保存长期等待状态，但“能收到 Signal”只是传输能力。审批 API 仍需认证调用者、验证其在当前规则版本下有权决定、生成不可重复使用的决策 ID，并把审计证据发送给 Workflow。否则任何能访问引擎的客户端都可能伪造审批。</p>\n<h2 id=\"hitl-的四种交互模式\">HITL 的四种交互模式</h2><p>人工介入环节在工作流中有四种典型的交互模式：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>语义</th>\n<th>超时行为</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>阻塞审批</strong></td>\n<td>等待人工批准/拒绝才继续</td>\n<td>超时=拒绝或升级</td>\n<td>贷款审批、采购审批</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>人工否决</strong></td>\n<td>自动执行除非人工阻止</td>\n<td>超时=自动通过</td>\n<td>AI 决策人工复核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>信息补充</strong></td>\n<td>等待人工提供缺失数据</td>\n<td>超时=提醒或取消</td>\n<td>表单补填、身份验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>人工分派</strong></td>\n<td>等待人工选择后续路径</td>\n<td>超时=默认路径</td>\n<td>异常工单路由</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这四种模式的工作流实现结构相似——核心都是「等待外部信号 + 超时兜底」——但业务语义不同导致超时行为不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"temporal-中的-hitl-实现\">Temporal 中的 HITL 实现</h2><p>Temporal 通过 Signal + Condition + Timer 的组合实现 HITL。以一个贷款审批流程为例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"export async function loanApprovalWorkflow(application: LoanApplication): Promise&lt;LoanDecision&gt; {&#10;  let decision: ApprovalDecision | null = null;&#10;&#10;  setHandler(approvalSignal, (incoming) =&gt; {&#10;    if (incoming.requestId !== application.approvalRequestId) return;&#10;    if (decision !== null) return;&#10;    decision = incoming;&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  // 自动化前置检查&#10;  const creditScore = await checkCreditScore(application.userId);&#10;  const riskLevel = await assessRisk(application, creditScore);&#10;&#10;  // 低风险自动通过&#10;  if (riskLevel === &#39;low&#39;) {&#10;    return { approved: true, rate: calculateRate(creditScore) };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 中高风险需要人工审批&#10;  await notifyApprover(application, riskLevel);&#10;&#10;  // 等待审批结果——最长 72 小时&#10;  const approved = await condition(&#10;    () =&gt; decision !== null, // 条件：收到审批信号&#10;    &#39;72 hours&#39;, // 超时：72 小时&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  if (!approved) {&#10;    // 超时未审批——升级到上级&#10;    await escalateToManager(application);&#10;    const escalated = await condition(() =&gt; decision !== null, &#39;24 hours&#39;);&#10;    if (!escalated) {&#10;      return { approved: false, reason: &#39;approval_timeout&#39; };&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return {&#10;    approved: decision!.result === &#39;approve&#39;,&#10;    rate: decision!.suggestedRate,&#10;    approver: decision!.approverId,&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> loanApprovalWorkflow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">application</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> LoanApplication</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">LoanDecision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ApprovalDecision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  setHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(approvalSignal, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">incoming</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (incoming.requestId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> application.approvalRequestId) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (decision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    decision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> incoming;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 自动化前置检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> creditScore</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> checkCreditScore</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(application.userId);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> riskLevel</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> assessRisk</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(application, creditScore);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 低风险自动通过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (riskLevel </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { approved: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, rate: </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">calculateRate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(creditScore) };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 中高风险需要人工审批</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> notifyApprover</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(application, riskLevel);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 等待审批结果——最长 72 小时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> approved</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 条件：收到审批信号</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    '72 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 超时：72 小时</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">approved) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 超时未审批——升级到上级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> escalateToManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(application);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> escalated</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> condition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> decision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'24 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">escalated) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { approved: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, reason: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'approval_timeout'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    approved: decision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'approve'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    rate: decision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.suggestedRate,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    approver: decision</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.approverId,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Signal Handler 定义了工作流如何接收外部输入：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Signal Handler——外部审批系统通过 Signal 传入审批结果&#10;const approvalSignal = defineSignal&lt;[ApprovalDecision]&gt;(&#39;approval&#39;);&#10;&#10;// 在工作流中注册 Handler&#10;setHandler(approvalSignal, (result: ApprovalDecision) =&gt; {&#10;  if (result.requestId !== pendingRequestId) return;&#10;  if (decision !== null) return;&#10;  decision = result;&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Signal Handler——外部审批系统通过 Signal 传入审批结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> approvalSignal</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineSignal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;[</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ApprovalDecision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'approval'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 在工作流中注册 Handler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(approvalSignal, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ApprovalDecision</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (result.requestId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pendingRequestId) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (decision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> null</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  decision </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>示例中的 Handler 只负责确定性的状态转换；身份认证、角色校验和签名验证应在审批 API 或专门 Activity 中完成，因为 Workflow 不能访问外部身份系统。Workflow 仍要核对请求 ID、规则版本与当前等待阶段，并让重复决定幂等。若先收到“通过”后又收到“拒绝”，不能用最后写入覆盖审计事实，而应拒绝冲突并触发调查。</p>\n<h2 id=\"审批流程的完整架构\">审批流程的完整架构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"sequenceDiagram\" data-source=\"sequenceDiagram&#10;    participant WF as 工作流实例&#10;    participant S as Temporal Server&#10;    participant API as 审批 API&#10;    participant UI as 审批 UI&#10;    participant Approver as 审批人&#10;&#10;    WF-&gt;&gt;S: 进入等待状态(condition)&#10;    Note over WF: 休眠,不消耗资源&#10;    WF-&gt;&gt;API: 发送待审批通知&#10;    API-&gt;&gt;UI: 创建审批任务&#10;    UI-&gt;&gt;Approver: 展示待审批列表&#10;&#10;    Note over Approver: 数小时后...&#10;    Approver-&gt;&gt;UI: 点击「通过」&#10;    UI-&gt;&gt;API: POST /approve&#10;    API-&gt;&gt;S: Signal(workflowId, &#39;approval&#39;, {result: &#39;approve&#39;})&#10;    S-&gt;&gt;WF: 传递 Signal&#10;    Note over WF: condition 满足,恢复执行&#10;    WF-&gt;&gt;WF: 继续后续流程\">sequenceDiagram\n    participant WF as 工作流实例\n    participant S as Temporal Server\n    participant API as 审批 API\n    participant UI as 审批 UI\n    participant Approver as 审批人\n\n    WF-&gt;&gt;S: 进入等待状态(condition)\n    Note over WF: 休眠,不消耗资源\n    WF-&gt;&gt;API: 发送待审批通知\n    API-&gt;&gt;UI: 创建审批任务\n    UI-&gt;&gt;Approver: 展示待审批列表\n\n    Note over Approver: 数小时后...\n    Approver-&gt;&gt;UI: 点击「通过」\n    UI-&gt;&gt;API: POST /approve\n    API-&gt;&gt;S: Signal(workflowId, 'approval', {result: 'approve'})\n    S-&gt;&gt;WF: 传递 Signal\n    Note over WF: condition 满足,恢复执行\n    WF-&gt;&gt;WF: 继续后续流程</pre><p>关键实现细节：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>审批 API 持有受限的 Workflow 引用</strong>：UI 不应直接持有通用 Temporal 凭据；API 把经过鉴权的业务决定映射到指定 Workflow 和请求 ID</li>\n<li><strong>等待期间零资源消耗</strong>：工作流状态持久化在 Server 端，Worker 可以处理其他任务</li>\n<li><strong>审批消息可持久交付</strong>：Worker 不在线时 Signal 进入历史；应用仍要处理调用重试造成的重复消息与过期决定</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"决策信封与权限边界\">决策信封与权限边界</h2><p>审批输入不应只有布尔值。最小决策信封可以包含：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>requestId</code></td>\n<td>绑定一次具体审批请求并用于去重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>workflowId</code> / <code>businessId</code></td>\n<td>建立执行实例与业务实体的关联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>policyVersion</code></td>\n<td>证明该决定依据哪版规则与阈值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>actorId</code> / <code>actorRole</code></td>\n<td>记录谁以何种角色决定；由可信边界断言</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>decision</code> / <code>reasonCode</code></td>\n<td>表达结构化结果，避免自由文本驱动控制流</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>decidedAt</code> / <code>expiresAt</code></td>\n<td>拒绝过期或窗口外的决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>decisionId</code></td>\n<td>让 API、审计库和 Workflow 共享同一回执</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>审批 API 应先在自己的审计库原子写入 <code>decisionId</code>，再向 Workflow 发送 Signal 或 Update；发送超时时按相同 ID 重试。Workflow 接收后把 ID 保存在状态中，重复消息返回同一结果。若要求调用方同步知道“决定已被 Workflow 接受”，Update 比异步 Signal 更合适，但仍不能替代业务审计库。</p>\n<h2 id=\"多级审批与会签\">多级审批与会签</h2><p>复杂的审批场景往往需要多级审批或多人会签。工作流引擎让这类逻辑的表达非常自然：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// 多级审批：按金额分级&#10;async function multiLevelApproval(amount: number): Promise&lt;boolean&gt; {&#10;  // Level 1: 直接主管&#10;  const l1 = await waitForApproval(&#39;supervisor&#39;, &#39;48 hours&#39;);&#10;  if (!l1.approved) return false;&#10;&#10;  // Level 2: 部门经理（仅大额）&#10;  if (amount &gt; 100000) {&#10;    const l2 = await waitForApproval(&#39;department_head&#39;, &#39;48 hours&#39;);&#10;    if (!l2.approved) return false;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // Level 3: CFO（仅超大额）&#10;  if (amount &gt; 1000000) {&#10;    const l3 = await waitForApproval(&#39;cfo&#39;, &#39;72 hours&#39;);&#10;    if (!l3.approved) return false;&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  return true;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 会签：多人并行审批，需要全部通过&#10;async function parallelApproval(approvers: string[]): Promise&lt;boolean&gt; {&#10;  const results = await Promise.all(approvers.map((approver) =&gt; waitForApproval(approver, &#39;48 hours&#39;)));&#10;  return results.every((r) =&gt; r.approved);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 多级审批：按金额分级</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> multiLevelApproval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> number</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // Level 1: 直接主管</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> waitForApproval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'supervisor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'48 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">l1.approved) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // Level 2: 部门经理（仅大额）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> waitForApproval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'department_head'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'48 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">l2.approved) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // Level 3: CFO（仅超大额）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1000000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l3</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> waitForApproval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cfo'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'72 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">l3.approved) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 会签：多人并行审批，需要全部通过</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> parallelApproval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">approvers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[])</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> results</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(approvers.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">approver</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> waitForApproval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(approver, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'48 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">every</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">r</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r.approved);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"query-实现进度查询\">Query 实现进度查询</h2><p>审批等待期间，业务方和审批人需要实时了解流程进度。Temporal 的 Query 机制提供了<strong>不改变状态的只读查询</strong>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>交互方式</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>是否修改状态</th>\n<th>响应方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Signal</td>\n<td>传入审批结果</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>异步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Query</td>\n<td>查询当前进度</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>同步返回</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Update</td>\n<td>即时交互</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>同步返回</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// Query Handler——随时可查询工作流当前状态&#10;const statusQuery = defineQuery&lt;WorkflowStatus&gt;(&#39;status&#39;);&#10;setHandler(statusQuery, () =&gt; ({&#10;  currentStep: currentStep,&#10;  waitingFor: pendingApprover,&#10;  waitingSince: waitStartTime,&#10;  timeoutAt: deadlineTime,&#10;}));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Query Handler——随时可查询工作流当前状态</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> statusQuery</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> defineQuery</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WorkflowStatus</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'status'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(statusQuery, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currentStep: currentStep,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  waitingFor: pendingApprover,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  waitingSince: waitStartTime,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  timeoutAt: deadlineTime,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}));</span></span></code></pre></div><p>审批 UI 可以通过 Query 读取最新内存状态，但 Query 需要兼容 Worker 在线处理，也不会成为持久业务证据。大规模列表和报表应使用 Visibility/Search Attributes 或业务读模型；最终审计应以事件历史和审批系统的不可变决策记录交叉核对。</p>\n<h2 id=\"超时与升级策略\">超时与升级策略</h2><p>HITL 场景中，超时处理策略直接影响业务体验：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"stateDiagram-v2\" data-source=\"stateDiagram-v2&#10;    [*] --&gt; 等待审批&#10;    等待审批 --&gt; 已通过: 审批人通过&#10;    等待审批 --&gt; 已拒绝: 审批人拒绝&#10;    等待审批 --&gt; 催办: 24h 未响应&#10;    催办 --&gt; 已通过: 审批人通过&#10;    催办 --&gt; 已拒绝: 审批人拒绝&#10;    催办 --&gt; 升级: 48h 仍未响应&#10;    升级 --&gt; 上级审批: 转交上级&#10;    上级审批 --&gt; 已通过: 上级通过&#10;    上级审批 --&gt; 已拒绝: 上级拒绝&#10;    上级审批 --&gt; 自动处理: 72h 超时&#10;    自动处理 --&gt; 已拒绝: 默认拒绝&#10;    已通过 --&gt; [*]&#10;    已拒绝 --&gt; [*]\">stateDiagram-v2\n    [*] --&gt; 等待审批\n    等待审批 --&gt; 已通过: 审批人通过\n    等待审批 --&gt; 已拒绝: 审批人拒绝\n    等待审批 --&gt; 催办: 24h 未响应\n    催办 --&gt; 已通过: 审批人通过\n    催办 --&gt; 已拒绝: 审批人拒绝\n    催办 --&gt; 升级: 48h 仍未响应\n    升级 --&gt; 上级审批: 转交上级\n    上级审批 --&gt; 已通过: 上级通过\n    上级审批 --&gt; 已拒绝: 上级拒绝\n    上级审批 --&gt; 自动处理: 72h 超时\n    自动处理 --&gt; 已拒绝: 默认拒绝\n    已通过 --&gt; [*]\n    已拒绝 --&gt; [*]</pre><p>渐进式超时策略的实现：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>T+24h</strong>：发送催办通知（邮件/IM/短信）</li>\n<li><strong>T+48h</strong>：自动升级到上级审批人</li>\n<li><strong>T+72h</strong>：按业务规则自动处理（通过或拒绝）</li>\n<li><strong>全程</strong>：记录完整审计轨迹</li>\n</ol>\n<p>计时窗口应基于 Workflow 的重放安全时钟，并把截止时间固化为业务状态。提醒 Activity 可以失败重试，但提醒失败不应悄悄延长审批期限。收到决定与 Timer 到期可能在相邻事件中竞争，因此必须定义稳定优先级：例如“Service 接收时间不晚于 <code>expiresAt</code> 才有效”，而不是依赖 Worker 本地处理顺序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"人工否决模式-human-veto\">人工否决模式（Human-Veto）</h2><p>与阻塞审批相反，Human-Veto 模式默认自动执行，只在人工明确否决时才停止：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"async function humanVetoPattern(action: Action): Promise&lt;ActionResult&gt; {&#10;  let vetoed = false;&#10;  setHandler(vetoSignal, (veto) =&gt; {&#10;    if (veto.requestId === action.reviewRequestId) vetoed = true;&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  // 通知人工——给一个窗口期&#10;  await notifyReviewer(action);&#10;&#10;  // 等待 4 小时否决窗口&#10;  await sleep(&#39;4 hours&#39;);&#10;&#10;  if (vetoed) {&#10;    return { status: &#39;vetoed&#39;, action: &#39;none&#39; };&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  // 窗口期内无否决——自动执行&#10;  return await executeAction(action);&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> humanVetoPattern</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">action</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Action</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ActionResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> vetoed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  setHandler</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(vetoSignal, (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">veto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (veto.requestId </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> action.reviewRequestId) vetoed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 通知人工——给一个窗口期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> notifyReviewer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(action);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 等待 4 小时否决窗口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> sleep</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'4 hours'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (vetoed) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { status: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'vetoed'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, action: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'none'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 窗口期内无否决——自动执行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> executeAction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(action);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Human-Veto 只适合风险受限、可逆且组织已经明确批准“沉默即放行”的动作。转账、删除、公开发布、权限提升和合规决定不应因审批人未响应而自动执行。用于 AI Agent 时还应把工具、参数、资源范围和计划摘要固化在审查版本中；审查后任何计划变化都必须生成新的请求，不能沿用旧窗口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"取消-转交与数据保护\">取消、转交与数据保护</h2><p>审批人离职、权限变化、请假转交和发起方撤销都是独立事件。取消 Workflow 不等于撤销审批任务；流程需要 Activity 关闭外部待办，并用同一请求 ID确认任务已失效。迟到决定到达时，Handler 根据当前阶段和 <code>expiresAt</code> 拒绝，而不是重新打开流程。</p>\n<p>Signal、Query、Search Attributes 和事件历史可能包含个人身份、意见与业务敏感字段。只把路由所需的低敏字段放入可检索属性，正文载荷使用加密 codec 或外部受控存储；审批 UI、Codec 解密端点与运维人员的读取权限都要进入审计。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>工作流引擎为长期等待提供 Signal、Timer 与持久状态，但生产级人工环节还需要决策信封、鉴权、幂等、冲突规则、取消传播和数据保护。开发者不仅要描述“等谁、等多久”，还要证明“谁有权决定、重复或迟到决定怎样处理、证据保存在哪里”。前文的 <a href=\"saga-compensation\">Saga 补偿</a>处理部分成功，下一节<a href=\"versioning-migration\">版本迁移</a>处理审批规则和 Worker 代码变化。</p>\n<p>Temporal 对 Signal、Query、Update 的当前边界可对照 <a href=\"https://docs.temporal.io/encyclopedia/workflow-message-passing\">Workflow message passing</a>，载荷保护可对照 <a href=\"https://docs.temporal.io/production-deployment/data-encryption\">Codecs and Encryption</a>；截至 2026 年 8 月核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"人工审批环节的建模与实现","id":"人工审批环节的建模与实现"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么工作流需要人工介入","id":"为什么工作流需要人工介入"},{"level":2,"text":"HITL 的四种交互模式","id":"hitl-的四种交互模式"},{"level":2,"text":"Temporal 中的 HITL 实现","id":"temporal-中的-hitl-实现"},{"level":2,"text":"审批流程的完整架构","id":"审批流程的完整架构"},{"level":2,"text":"决策信封与权限边界","id":"决策信封与权限边界"},{"level":2,"text":"多级审批与会签","id":"多级审批与会签"},{"level":2,"text":"Query 实现进度查询","id":"query-实现进度查询"},{"level":2,"text":"超时与升级策略","id":"超时与升级策略"},{"level":2,"text":"人工否决模式（Human-Veto）","id":"人工否决模式-human-veto"},{"level":2,"text":"取消、转交与数据保护","id":"取消-转交与数据保护"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Saga 补偿模式在工作流引擎中的实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/patterns/saga-compensation"},"next":{"title":"工作流版本化与迁移","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/workflow-engine-orchestration/patterns/versioning-migration"}}